      "id": 310,
      "q": "A bank has $2 million in deposits, $260,000 in reserves and a 10% reserve requirement. It lends all excess reserves, and the payment is deposited at a second bank. The second bank holds $10,000 from that deposit. A report says all $10,000 must be required reserves. Is that supported?",
