      "repairSkill": "seigniorage_feedback",
      "commonError": "Treats money creation as a costless financing source regardless of public money demand.",
      "feedback": "Heavy money finance can raise inflation expectations and reduce desired real money balances, making continued reliance on seigniorage increasingly disruptive.",
