      "q": "At a fixed reference price, AD must shift right by $500 billion to meet the policy target. Monetary policy raises autonomous investment by $50 billion, government purchases rise by $60 billion, and fiscal crowding out reduces autonomous investment by $40 billion. MPC = 0.75; apply the same simple multiplier to each autonomous change, with no other leakages. What AD shortfall remains?",
