      "id": "ERQ-PM2C2-ITAX-LB-001",
      "q": "A household owes a fixed nominal $300. Prices fall 10%. A lender proposes reducing nominal principal by 10% to keep the debt's real burden at its pre-deflation level. Would that adjustment accomplish the stated goal?",
